  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uKZEWLR.png\" alt=\"Pack Banner\" width=\"700\" height=\"450\" /></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J9jY4Z6\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YeQZceJ.png\" alt=\"Discord Badge\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dr_prof_Luigi\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24auqwO.png\" alt=\"Patreon Badge\" width=\"234\" height=\"76\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-end-of-minecraft\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Om4BpzM.png\" alt=\"TEOM Badge\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-parts-pack\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d51JHWL.png\" alt=\"This Pack uses Quality UNU Parts\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br /><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lCmsctToQt0\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模组需要以下前置模组：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Minecraft Transport Simulator</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-parts-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">UNU Parts Pack</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-railroading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Immersive Railroading（可选）*</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>下载我的其他模组包！</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><br /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">UNU Civilian - 来自UNU的高质量民用汽车、卡车、飞机和火车！</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-air-cooled-vehicles-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MTS Air-Cooled Pack - 大众、Corvair及其他风冷汽车！</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-unuverse-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Expanded UNUverse Pack - 来自UNU宇宙（超越BlackThorne）的载具！</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iconic-movie-vehicles-pack-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Iconic Film Vehicles - 经典电影载具（2015年经典）<br /><br /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fallout-mc\"><strong>试试官方服务器！</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /><br />所有载具均提供黑棘蓝（BlackThorne Blue）涂装，以及沙漠、森林和冬季迷彩。<br /><br />载具列表：<br />UNU Wolf [NR-490-LTG]<br />UNU Mule [ZF-174-MCG] - 多种配置<br /><br />如果您安装了Immersive Railroading*，您还将获得一把巨型列车炮**。<br /><br />更多载具即将推出！<br /><br />*如果您将文件的后缀从 .jar 改为 .zip，它即可作为IR资源包使用，且无需MTS。<br /><br />**列车炮目前暂未实装，但老实说，只要有人看到它，绝对会让人感到不寒而栗。</p>",
